  "notes": "更新更顺畅，到期提醒更清晰。\n\n- 支持后台下载更新并一键安装，安装成功后清理更新文件，默认使用可稍后处理的更新提示。\n- iOS 缺少 App Store 更新链接时使用已签名的发布链接，并修正更新横幅关闭行为。\n- 统一界面图标与主题配色，精简功能卡片，移除旧版悦视频网页。\n- 增加每日订阅到期提醒，优化注册后的套餐引导，帮助与服务状态保持原生体验。\n- 改进诊断地区信息关联，并加强更新和提醒相关的稳定性测试。\n",
  "notesEn": "Smoother updates and clearer renewal reminders.\n\n- Download updates in the background and apply them with one tap, clean up installed update files, and allow deferring update prompts by default.\n- Use the signed release link on iOS when no App Store update link is available, and fix dismissing update banners.\n- Unify icons and theme colors, simplify feature cards, and remove the retired Emby web page.\n- Add daily subscription expiry reminders, improve plan guidance after registration, and keep help and service status native.\n- Improve diagnostic region attribution and strengthen update and reminder stability tests.\n",
